(define (problem temp)(:domain grid)(:objects 
   zero  - num 
   one  - num 
   two  - num 
   int1  - interpretation 
   int2  - interpretation 
   int3  - interpretation 
   int4  - interpretation 
   int5  - interpretation 
   int6  - interpretation 
)
(:init (true)
  (y zero int1)
  (x zero int1)
  (x zero int2)
  (y one int2)
  (canmove int2)
  (x zero int3)
  (y two int3)
  (x one int4)
  (y two int4)
  (canmove int5)
  (x two int5)
  (y zero int5)
  (y two int6)
  (x two int6)
)
(:goal (forall (?interpr - interpretation)(and   (x one ?interpr)  (y zero ?interpr)))))